{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1304641166"}, "name":{"label":"Ashytrash"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-26T19:16:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12468894057"}, "title":{"label":"Great App! Super Helpful! Some improvements needed"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app. It’s my first day using it and it’s already been super helpful. I can tell that it will be useful for a long time. It’s very good at what it does without being too restrictive and actually gets you outside, which helps your productivity and gives you the boost you need to do something other than bedrot all day.\nHowever it gets really depressing to look at my screen time totals and see eight hours because I spent three hours driving in maps is counted on those totals or because I spent an hour studying in Safari is counted on those totals. It would be really helpful to have the option to remove some apps from your screen time totals :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
