{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id430683681"}, "name":{"label":"Gonetillnoon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-24T20:24:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12461274291"}, "title":{"label":"Settings control"}, "content":{"label":"Idea of the app is awesome. It was great at locking me out of the apps. I went for a walk in the middle of the day and touched grass and it rejected my photos. \nIt has a couple programming things that need to be adjusted. \nNeed to make the wording of your settings more clear. It’s extremely confusing. I should have the ability to choose to choose what hours throughout the day to lock the apps and do the touch grass or be able to click 24 hour lock and have the window of 1 hour or longer of a break or unless I touch grass for a little break outside that window of long break. \nThe time setting for when I could do my break was restricting me to 1pm-2pm or 8am-9am. All other choices would jump me to those times.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1312956749"}, "name":{"label":"Nerd358"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-24T19:55:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12461205405"}, "title":{"label":"Glitch/app issues"}, "content":{"label":"Cool idea, but there are significant app issues when trying to set it up for the first time. There are multiple different texts/buttons on top of each other in the block list and it’s messing with the functionality of the app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1768986472"}, "name":{"label":"CupSaysSubToTechnoblade"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-03-23T23:29:02-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.2"}, "id":{"label":"12457622369"}, "title":{"label":"Time frame is difficult to understand"}, "content":{"label":"The app itself is very well made and seems simple enough. I’ve been using it for the past two weeks or so. The only part I found frustrating was the time frame for when the app starts and the time used for breaks. I can see where for most people this app would work great, but I work graveshifts and need my phone for a number of things during that time. It would be nice to have more control of what days you want the app to work, and what time frames during those days. \n\nAside from that, I think the app is charming and definitely kept me off my phone during my down times.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6739589530&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
